    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d508">

                <pb facs="0494" n="482" sameAs="frus:frus1943v04/pg482"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">811.24591/19: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Minister in Iran</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Dreyfus</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1943-11-24T15:00:00-04:00">November 24,
                            1943—3 p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>588. War Department asks that you obtain General Connolly’s comment on changes
                    requested in your telegram no. 1064, November <pb facs="0495" n="483"
                        xml:id="pg483"/> 20, 4 p.m. War Department is prepared to act as soon as
                    comment is received.</p>
                <p>War Department desires this because Connolly has authority to enlist certain men
                    such as interpreters.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
